# Files/folders to exclude from memory ingestion
.env
.env.*
secrets/
credentials/
**/node_modules/**
**/.git/**
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite

# The frozen GitNexus reference oracle. Two JSONL data files, 57,249 records
# between them, read only by src/codegraph/reference/compare.mjs to score a new
# parser against the snapshot. Indexing them is both useless -- they are data,
# not code anyone searches for -- and the one thing that makes a whole-repository
# ingest die: every other directory in this repo ingests on its own, this one
# exhausts native memory and takes the process down with an access violation.
/src/codegraph/reference/snapshot/
